### def each_entry {|pathname| ... } -> nil
Dir.foreach(self.to_s) {|f| yield Pathname.new(f) } と同じです。


```ruby title="例"
require "pathname"

Pathname("/usr/local").each_entry {|f| p f }

# => #<Pathname:.>
# => #<Pathname:..>
# => #<Pathname:bin>
# => #<Pathname:etc>
# => #<Pathname:include>
# => #<Pathname:lib>
# => #<Pathname:opt>
```

- **SEE** [m:Dir.foreach]


